  "id": "BRISNIK-HR-B3",
  "label": "Brisnik: tricyclic at 50 mg a day or more, trazodone or tranylcypromine with a blood pressure lowering medicine at age 65 or over",
  "family": "BRISNIK",
  "title": "Tricyclic antidepressant, trazodone or tranylcypromine with another blood pressure lowering medicine, age 65 or over",
  "statement": "Prescribed TCA (in doses ≥ 50 mg/day), trazodone, or tranylcypromine - and the patient is aged ≥ 65 years and co-prescribed ≥ 1 further drug with known blood pressure lowering effect (e.g., α-blockers, β-blockers, nitrates, SGLT inhibitors, levodopa, antipsychotics)[c]",
  "statement_origin": "published",
  "source": {
    "document": "Brisnik V, et al. Deprescribing of antidepressants: indicators of high-risk and overprescribing. BMC Med 2024;22:193, Tables 3-4",
